id: divine-movement
name: Divine Movement
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerBaseTier: 4
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
encounterLimit: 3
# A God Maneuver: open where an effect grants it, only in God Ki, its 4(bT) paid in Divine Ki Points (maneuvers.mjs
# whyNotGod, spendManeuverCost). Its own Maneuver rather than the Movement Maneuver (chat.mjs takeDivineMovement): no
# card an Opponent's Blockade or Exploit answers - "does not trigger the Exploit Maneuver", and the Movement Maneuver only
# "for any of your effects" - so Fake Death's Hidden ends by it. The Square is moved to on the map, as every Movement is.
# "[1/Round, 3/Encounter]": both limits, the second counted on its own (encounterLimit).
godManeuver: true
divineMovement: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A God Maneuver: move to any Square within your Boosted Speed - no Exploit, and the Movement Maneuver for your effects.
text: >
  Divine Movement [1/Round, 3/Encounter]: Dart across the battlefield with divine speed.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –DKP Cost: 4(bT)
  –Effect: Move to any Square within range of your Boosted Speed. This Movement does not trigger the Exploit Maneuver and
  is considered the Movement Maneuver for any of your effects.
